  "model_output": "```sql\nWITH nature_park AS (\n  SELECT \n    id,\n    geometry\n  FROM pois\n  WHERE poi_name ILIKE 'Wildlife West Nature Park'\n    AND addr_city = 'Edgewood'\n    AND addr_state = 'NM'\n),\nhigh_elevation_areas AS (\n  SELECT \n    ST_Union(rast) AS rast\n  FROM public.dem_us\n  WHERE ST_Intersects(\n    rast,\n    ST_Buffer(nature_park.geometry::geometry, 500)\n  )\n    AND ST_Value(rast, 1) >= 1300\n  FROM nature_park\n),\nbuffered_area AS (\n  SELECT \n    ST_Buffer(nature_park.geometry::geometry, 500) AS geom\n  FROM nature_park\n)\nSELECT \n  np.id,\n  np.poi_name,\n  np.geometry\nFROM nature_park np\nWHERE ST_Intersects(\n  np.geometry::geometry,\n  buffered_area.geom\n)\n  AND ST_Intersects(\n    np.geometry::geometry,\n    high_elevation_areas.rast\n  )\nCROSS JOIN buffered_area\nCROSS JOIN high_elevation_areas;\n```",
